{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q12072315","formula":"C₆H₁₁NO₄","hill":"C6H11NO4","elements":["H","C","N","O"],"composition":{"C":6.0,"H":11.0,"N":1.0,"O":4.0},"names":{"en":"(2S,4R)-2-amino-4-methylpentanedioic acid","uk":"SYM2081"},"descriptions":{"en":"SYM-2081 is a highly selective agonist for the kainate receptor. This potent agonist has nearly 3,000 fold- and 200-fold selectivity for kainate receptors over AMPA and NMDA receptors, respectively. Given its potency and selectivity, it is a useful ligand for studying the role of kainate receptors in the central nervous system.","uk":"(2S,4R)-4-метилглутамінова кислота ((2S,4R)-4-Methylglutamic acid, SYM2081) — сильний та високоселективний агоніст каїнатних рецепторів, з меншою активністю на АМРА- та NMDA-рецепторах. Окрім того, у високих концентраціях здатний інгібіювати роботу транспортера збуджуючих амінокислот ЕААТ2."},"fame":5,"pubchemCid":95883,"mass":161.16,"charge":0,"smiles":"C[C@H](C[C@@H](C(=O)O)N)C(=O)O","inchikey":"KRKRAOXTGDJWNI-DMTCNVIQSA-N","iupac":"(2S,4R)-2-amino-4-methylpentanedioic acid","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"95883","atoms":22,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":3.02,"y":-0.047,"z":1.207,"el":"O"},{"x":-2.575,"y":1.4,"z":-0.691,"el":"O"},{"x":1.924,"y":1.672,"z":0.215,"el":"O"},{"x":-3.401,"y":-0.517,"z":0.197,"el":"O"},{"x":-1.067,"y":-1.286,"z":1.208,"el":"N"},{"x":-0.079,"y":-0.227,"z":-0.765,"el":"C"},{"x":1.378,"y":-0.613,"z":-0.44,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.028,"y":-0.043,"z":0.43,"el":"C"},{"x":2.164,"y":-1.037,"z":-1.679,"el":"C"},{"x":2.116,"y":0.469,"z":0.334,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.453,"y":0.23,"z":-0.014,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.074,"y":0.702,"z":-1.353,"el":"H"},{"x":-0.502,"y":-0.989,"z":-1.436,"el":"H"},{"x":1.341,"y":-1.492,"z":0.218,"el":"H"},{"x":-0.701,"y":0.774,"z":1.081,"el":"